{"about_the_game":"Everything you could possibly want from an arcade adventure!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nBattle your way through risky woods and murky caves. Stomping Skeletons....traps to trick you....face-gripping flying fiends!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nFortunately, you - the young warrior Rohan - have arrived to deliver justice to the evil hordes. With weapons in hand you must enter the risky woods and free the monks from their petrified captivity. Only when you've set the monks free and sent Draxos back to hell will wisdom be restored for good.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThis game is an action platformer very similar to shoot'em up games like turrican, jim power and contra. <br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe Game Features:<br />\r\n<br />\r\n    \u202212 Levels, 8 landscapes and 150 screens.<br />\r\n    \u202211 professionally composed musical scores.<br />\r\n    \u2022Over 20 different devious enemies to destroy.<br />\r\n    \u2022Power ups with axes, fireballs, chains and more!","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1920520?t=1675268990","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1920520?t=1675268990","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1920520/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1675268990","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1920520/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1675268990","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"Everything you could possibly want from an arcade adventure!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nBattle your way through risky woods and murky caves. Stomping Skeletons....traps to trick you....face-gripping flying fiends!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nFortunately, you - the young warrior Rohan - have arrived to deliver justice to the evil hordes. With weapons in hand you must enter the risky woods and free the monks from t